      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 1  Psychoactive substances\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 12, 2015",
