    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "205EA(4) Treatment of goods seized if a claim for return is made—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The goods are condemned as forfeited to the Crown if:\n\n(a) the claimant does not institute proceedings of a kind referred\nto in paragraph (2)(b) within the period of 30 days after\nreceiving the notice under that paragraph (or within that\nperiod as extended, or further extended, under\nsection 205EB); or\n\n(b) the claimant institutes such proceedings within that period (or\nwithin that period as extended or further extended), and at the\nend of the proceedings there is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 1  Psychoactive substances\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 12, 2015\n\n(i) an order for the claimant to recover the goods; or\n\n(ii) an order for the Commonwealth to pay the claimant the\nmarket value of the goods at the time they were\ndisposed of or destroyed, if they have been disposed of\nor destroyed before the end of the proceedings; or\n\n(iii) a declaration that the goods are not forfeited.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The goods are condemned as forfeited to the Crown if:\n\n(a) the claimant does not institute proceedings of a kind referred\nto in paragraph (2)(b) within the period of 30 days after\nreceiving the notice under that paragraph (or within that\nperiod as extended, or further extended, under\nsection 205EB); or\n\n(b) the claimant institutes such proceedings within that period (or\nwithin that period as extended or further extended), and at the\nend of the proceedings there is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 1  Psychoactive substances\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 12, 2015\n\n(i) an order for the claimant to recover the goods; or\n\n(ii) an order for the Commonwealth to pay the claimant the\nmarket value of the goods at the time they were\ndisposed of or destroyed, if they have been disposed of\nor destroyed before the end of the proceedings; or\n\n(iii) a declaration that the goods are not forfeited.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205ea"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5caf1fe60622163aeee095be7028d6bf52fd65c9c4afd9cc5e2e72abdc328d90",
      "skos:note": "Goods are condemned as forfeited to the Crown if certain conditions are not met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "205EA(4) Treatment of goods seized if a claim for return is made—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The goods are condemned as forfeited to the Crown if:\n\n(a) the claimant does not institute proceedings of a kind referred\nto in paragraph (2)(b) within the period of 30 days after\nreceiving the notice under that paragraph (or within that\nperiod as extended, or further extended, under\nsection 205EB); or\n\n(b) the claimant institutes such proceedings within that period (or\nwithin that period as extended or further extended), and at the\nend of the proceedings there is not:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 1  Psychoactive substances\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 12, 2015\n\n(i) an order for the claimant to recover the goods; or\n\n(ii) an order for the Commonwealth to pay the claimant the\nmarket value of the goods at the time they were\ndisposed of or destroyed, if they have been disposed of\nor destroyed before the end of the proceedings; or\n\n(iii) a declaration that the goods are not forfeited."
    },
