      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "39ba0fd1b2cb91700d1696cfdf10586f9f37bcb8db0c6314c0a422ee29aad977",
      "skos:note": "End of proceedings if appeal is lodged within the period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-205ea-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "205EA(5) Treatment of goods seized if a claim for return is made—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of subsection (4), if the proceedings go to\njudgment, they end:\n\n(a) at the end of the period for lodging an appeal against the\njudgment, if no appeal is lodged within that period; or\n\n(b) when the appeal lapses or is finally determined, if an appeal\nis lodged against the judgment within that period."
    },
