          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-2-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-2-sec-8-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b4c41c337fe321159ead2ed2021219a1c29330baf48519f054f6933ce976a5bb",
      "skos:note": "Defines firearm part within the meaning of the firearm law concerned."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Subsection 360.2(3) of the Criminal Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nfirearm part means either of the following within the meaning of\nthe firearm law concerned:\n\n(a) a firearm part;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 2  Firearms trafficking offences\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 12, 2015\n\n(b) a part of, or for, a firearm or weapon."
    },
