    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4B Suspended sentences of imprisonment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Serving a sentence of imprisonment includes being subject to so\nmuch of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as involves a\npotential deprivation of liberty.\nNote:\nWhile a person is subject to a suspended sentence of imprisonment, he\nor she is treated under this Act as a prisoner serving that sentence of\nimprisonment.\n\n(2) The suspended part of a sentence of imprisonment is so much of\nthe period of the sentence of imprisonment as:\n\n(a) involves a potential deprivation of liberty; and\n\n(b) is not a period of release on parole.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Serving a sentence of imprisonment includes being subject to so\nmuch of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as involves a\npotential deprivation of liberty.\nNote:\nWhile a person is subject to a suspended sentence of imprisonment, he\nor she is treated under this Act as a prisoner serving that sentence of\nimprisonment.\n\n(2) The suspended part of a sentence of imprisonment is so much of\nthe period of the sentence of imprisonment as:\n\n(a) involves a potential deprivation of liberty; and\n\n(b) is not a period of release on parole.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-4b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-4b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4584e0a9eb32de6b8c4338df18404b7512c34693d09f52bd3936620676ff0521"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4B Suspended sentences of imprisonment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Serving a sentence of imprisonment includes being subject to so\nmuch of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as involves a\npotential deprivation of liberty.\nNote:\nWhile a person is subject to a suspended sentence of imprisonment, he\nor she is treated under this Act as a prisoner serving that sentence of\nimprisonment.\n\n(2) The suspended part of a sentence of imprisonment is so much of\nthe period of the sentence of imprisonment as:\n\n(a) involves a potential deprivation of liberty; and\n\n(b) is not a period of release on parole."
    },
