    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-12",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12 Subsection 30(4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-12"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(4) However, if the prisoner:\n\n(a) has been released on parole; or\n\n(b) is serving the suspended part of the sentence of\nimprisonment;\nthe warrant is to specify any procedures for the transfer of the\nprisoner to Australia that have been agreed upon with the transfer\ncountry and to give any necessary authorisations and directions.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(4) However, if the prisoner:\n\n(a) has been released on parole; or\n\n(b) is serving the suspended part of the sentence of\nimprisonment;\nthe warrant is to specify any procedures for the transfer of the\nprisoner to Australia that have been agreed upon with the transfer\ncountry and to give any necessary authorisations and directions.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-12-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-12-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6ea71d0135a61157a7a08acf70064e891be33c738ef12b069adf5d5b1c82f583",
      "skos:note": "Specify procedures for prisoner transfer to Australia upon release or completion of suspended sentence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 Subsection 30(4)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(4) However, if the prisoner:\n\n(a) has been released on parole; or\n\n(b) is serving the suspended part of the sentence of\nimprisonment;\nthe warrant is to specify any procedures for the transfer of the\nprisoner to Australia that have been agreed upon with the transfer\ncountry and to give any necessary authorisations and directions."
    },
