      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\njoint prisoner means:\n\n(a) a prisoner who is serving sentences of imprisonment imposed\nunder the laws of 2 or more of the States and Territories; or\n\n(b) a federal prisoner who is also serving one or more sentences\nof imprisonment imposed under the laws of one or more of\nthe States and Territories."
