    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10A Decisions by the Attorney-General about transfers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making:\n\n(a) a decision on an application under section 16 (about transfers\nfrom Australia) for the transfer of a prisoner; or\n\n(b) a decision under section 24 (about transfers to Australia)\nabout a request for the transfer of a prisoner;\nif any of the following requirements for the transfer are not met:\n\n(c) paragraph 10(a), (c), (e) or (f);\n\n(d) paragraph 10(b), to the extent that it requires the agreement\nof the transfer country to the transfer;\n\n(e) paragraph 10(d), to the extent that it requires the consent of\nState Ministers or Territory Ministers to the transfer.\nNote:\nThe prisoner will be kept informed about the progress of the\napplication or request (see section 52).\n\n(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making:\n\n(a) a decision on an application under section 16 (about transfers\nfrom Australia) for the transfer of a prisoner; or\n\n(b) a decision under section 24 (about transfers to Australia)\nabout a request for the transfer of a prisoner;\nif any of the following requirements for the transfer are not met:\n\n(c) paragraph 10(a), (c), (e) or (f);\n\n(d) paragraph 10(b), to the extent that it requires the agreement\nof the transfer country to the transfer;\n\n(e) paragraph 10(d), to the extent that it requires the consent of\nState Ministers or Territory Ministers to the transfer.\nNote:\nThe prisoner will be kept informed about the progress of the\napplication or request (see section 52).\n\n(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "be000936054f65657e12a5a5ed5999eb804cadfca275708bace36f27f3563a5c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10A Decisions by the Attorney-General about transfers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making:\n\n(a) a decision on an application under section 16 (about transfers\nfrom Australia) for the transfer of a prisoner; or\n\n(b) a decision under section 24 (about transfers to Australia)\nabout a request for the transfer of a prisoner;\nif any of the following requirements for the transfer are not met:\n\n(c) paragraph 10(a), (c), (e) or (f);\n\n(d) paragraph 10(b), to the extent that it requires the agreement\nof the transfer country to the transfer;\n\n(e) paragraph 10(d), to the extent that it requires the consent of\nState Ministers or Territory Ministers to the transfer.\nNote:\nThe prisoner will be kept informed about the progress of the\napplication or request (see section 52).\n\n(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10A(1) Decisions by the Attorney-General about transfers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
