    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10A(2) Decisions by the Attorney-General about transfers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-10a-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "34f40aa42107bd1f68df6c6bd0fa93969adf22439d2e5bfac491f23a4802f91b",
      "skos:note": "The Attorney-General need not take steps for making a decision about prisoner transfer if an earlier application has been made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-10a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10A(2) Decisions by the Attorney-General about transfers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Attorney-General need not take any steps for making a\ndecision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) for the transfer of a\nprisoner if:\n\n(a) the prisoner had made an earlier application or request; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners"
    },
