      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country:\n\n(a) whether it consents to the transfer of a prisoner for whom an\napplication has been given under section 16; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country:\n\n(a) whether it consents to the transfer of a prisoner for whom an\napplication has been given under section 16; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners",
      "cml:asserts": [
