      "cml:integrityHash": "ba708abc851dfc15cb106c3421620daf8639d49794ed897799162ebb90a7cfcf",
      "skos:note": "The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country to consent to the transfer of a prisoner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-18-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18 Asking the transfer country to consent to the transfer",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country:\n\n(a) whether it consents to the transfer of a prisoner for whom an\napplication has been given under section 16; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nSchedule 3  International transfer of prisoners"
    },
