      "values:originalText": "Omit “that country”, substitute “a transfer country”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nInternational transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 3\n\nNo. 12, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015"
