      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-3-sec-41",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41 At the end of section 53",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; or (c) an APS employee who holds or performs the duties of an\nExecutive Level 2, or equivalent, position in the Department.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012\n\nInternational transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3\nApplication and transitional provisions  Part 4\n\nNo. 12, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015"
    },
