      "values:originalText": "(1) Proceedings for an offence against section 270.3, where the\nconduct constituting the alleged offence occurs wholly outside\nAustralia, must not take place except with the consent in writing of\nthe Attorney-General.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Proceedings for an offence against section 270.3, where the\nconduct constituting the alleged offence occurs wholly outside\nAustralia, must not take place except with the consent in writing of\nthe Attorney-General.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-4-sec-270-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
