      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 41,
      "values:originalText": "In this Schedule:\nCommonwealth place has the same meaning as in the Commonwealth\nPlaces (Application of Laws) Act 1970.\ndesignated State airport has the same meaning as in the Commonwealth\nPlaces (Application of Laws) Act 1970.\nmember of the Australian Federal Police has the same meaning as in\nthe Australian Federal Police Act 1979.\nrelevant Crimes Act provision has the same meaning as in the\nCommonwealth Places (Application of Laws) Act 1970.\nrelevant period means the period:\n\n(a) starting on 19 March 2014; and\n\n(b) ending on 16 May 2014.\nspecial member has the same meaning as in the Australian Federal\nPolice Act 1979."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-5-sec-1-norm",
