      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by items 1C and 1D apply to disclosures of\ninformation on or after the commencement of those items (whenever the\ninformation was given under section 49 of the Anti-Money Laundering\nand Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006).\nCriminal Code Act 1995",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by items 1C and 1D apply to disclosures of\ninformation on or after the commencement of those items (whenever the\ninformation was given under section 49 of the Anti-Money Laundering\nand Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006).\nCriminal Code Act 1995",
      "cml:asserts": [
